\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. JESU, my Truth, my Way,
\par My sure, unerring Light,
\par On Thee my feeble steps I stay,
\par Which Thou wilt guide aright.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My Wisdom and my Guide,
\par My Counsallor Thou art;
\par O never let me leave Thy side,
\par Or from Thy paths depart!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Teach me the happy art
\par In all things to depend
\par On Thee; O never, Lord, depart,
\par But love me to the end!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Through fire and water bring 
\par Into the wealthy place;
\par And teach me the new song to sing,
\par When perfected in grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O make me all like Thee,
\par Before I hence remove!
\par Settle, confirm, and stablish me.
\par And build me up in love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Let me Thy witness live,
\par When sin is all destroyed;
\par And then my spotless soul receive,
\par And take me home to God.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

